# Gate for the use-after-free fixed by discard_eval_module(): the throwaway
# module the paramod-signature builder folds `$bits(req_t)` in is deleted while
# name_map still points at the wire it fabricated for `req_t`.  Nothing in the
# netlist shows it -- whether the stale read corrupts anything depends on what
# the freed block happens to hold -- so valgrind is the oracle.  run_all_tests
# fails this test on any "Invalid read"/"Invalid write".
read_uhdm slpp_all/surelog.uhdm
hierarchy -check -top dut
